<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 168 0 R
/E (The current state of travel planning is fragmented and inefficient. Travelers often rely on multiple platforms to find hotels, plan itineraries, and discover nearby attractions. This process can be time-consuming and frustrating, leading to suboptimal travel experiences.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
207 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 168 0 R
/E (Our project aims to address these challenges by providing a comprehensive, user-friendly platform for travel planning. We will integrate hotel booking functionalities, real-time maps, and curated lists of nearby tourist attractions to streamline the entire travel planning process. By offering a one-stop solution, we aim to simplify travel planning and enhance the overall traveler experience.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
